  "reasoning": "The defendant used scanning and printing equipment to create sample counterfeit banknotes of various denominations and supplied them to another person who intended to produce counterfeit currency. This conduct constitutes the crime of counterfeiting currency under Chinese criminal law, i.e., 伪造货币罪. No other criminal conduct is described.",
